@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title Paquetages — responsabilites et dependances
caption Cadrage §10 · UC01–UC14 | Architecture cible
left to right direction
package "Interface / API" as API
package "Identites et acces" as AUTH
package "Catalogue" as CAT
package "Portefeuille et paiements" as MONEY
package "Achats et ouvertures" as OPEN
package "Inventaire et revente" as INV
package "Statistiques" as STATS
package "Progression et badges" as GAME
package "Administration" as ADMIN
package "Adaptateurs externes" as EXT
package "Persistance" as DB
API ..> AUTH : identite et autorisations
API ..> CAT
API ..> MONEY
API ..> OPEN
API ..> INV
API ..> STATS
API ..> GAME
API ..> ADMIN
OPEN ..> CAT : configuration de tirage
OPEN ..> MONEY : achat H1
OPEN ..> INV : attribution
STATS ..> OPEN : lecture des ouvertures validees
GAME ..> OPEN : actions validees si eligibles D4
GAME ..> AUTH : compte / profil
INV ..> MONEY : credit de revente
ADMIN ..> CAT : configuration autorisee
AUTH ..> EXT : SSO / emails
MONEY ..> EXT : prestataire paiement
AUTH ..> DB
MONEY ..> DB
OPEN ..> DB
INV ..> DB
GAME ..> DB
note bottom of API
  Decoupage logique cible ; pas des microservices deployes.
  Les modules metier ne sont pas tous presents dans le code.
  Contrats d'evenements / transactions a preciser (D4/D6).
end note
@enduml
